# inc-b4l3g.10: enter wizard mode and fix the rolls the inherent/lucubration
# check would otherwise leave to the seed. Menu order, top to bottom:
# 0 Cheat Death, 1 Auto-Identify, 2 Free Advancement, 3 Infinite Fatigue,
# 4 Always Rest Safely, 5 Ignore Spell Failure, ... 10 Freeze Monsters.
#  Free Advancement   : G on the character sheet gains a level.
#  Always Rest Safely : rest is safe and instant, so no encounter roll and no
#                       new monsters; it also lifts the depth-1 rest refusal.
#  Ignore Spell Failure: the percentile spell success roll always succeeds.
#  Freeze Monsters    : live monsters on the fixture level never act.
s
w y
@choose "Wizard Mode Switches"
DOWN*2 SPACE
DOWN*2 SPACE
DOWN SPACE
DOWN*5 SPACE
@dump:switches
ESC
@until "Things in View" ESC
